invariant: INV-10
file: tls_write.c
catches: webpki_loop_aes_extern
reason: the AES-GCM ceiling is applied to every suite a session selected,
  ChaCha20-Poly1305 included, whose sequence number wraps before any usage
  limit (rfc9846.txt:3752-3754). A ChaCha20 write key then sends a
  KeyUpdate at REC_AES_GCM_RECORDS_MAX - 1, which the ChaCha20 case counts.

--- old
    if (!suite_runs_aes_gcm(t->wr.suite)) {
        return SIZE_MAX;
    }
--- new
    if (t->wr.suite == 0) {
        return SIZE_MAX;
    }
